<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennst</unclear> zuvor,
<lb n="2"/>Ersamen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Weisen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonnders</unclear> lieben
<lb n="3"/>und gueten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Was an uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> lieber burger <persName resp="#ner">Jacob
<lb n="5"/>Egger</persName> der elter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">supplicirt</unclear> und gebetten,
<lb n="6"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ingelegter</unclear> seiner uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anheut</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>dato <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ubergebnen</unclear> supplication mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mererm</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>.
<lb n="9"/>Wann wir dann die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> irem wol-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">faren</unclear> und allem gueten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuebefuerdern</unclear>, so
<lb n="11"/>wol schuldig alls genaigt, und nun nach
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrofnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear>, deß <persName resp="#ner">Melchior <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buechels</unclear></persName>
