<lb n="26"/>supplication angezogner ursachen willen.
<lb n="27"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waferr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orts</unclear> in specie und sonder-
<lb n="28"/>bar, wider E. E. W. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herkomen</unclear> und
